{"app":"email-builder","comment":"Single source of truth for the Email Builder walk, consumed by the mock runner (tools/walk/run.mjs) and, next, by the toil-killer extension executor (spec §4.1). Steps run in array order; consecutive steps sharing a `visit` run on one page. honesty metadata: mockLimited (why the mock host cannot fully prove this state, or null), liveClass (per spec §6: live | live-user-confirm | live-limited | scratch-only | skip-live), spends (true when completing the step involves a real Buzz spend, by the user's own confirm click on live). executor 'data' steps carry their full assertion list in `checks`; 'code' steps dispatch to the handler of the same name in run.mjs — the catalog fails loudly on any drift between the two.","groups":["first-run","library","interview","bundle","preview","banner","library-ops","walls"],"steps":[{"checks":[{"kind":"exists","label":"app shell renders","testid":"eb-app"},{"kind":"textContains","label":"greeting opens the interview","testid":"eb-transcript","text":"Tell me about the email"},{"kind":"absent","label":"no preview card before content (incremental reveal)","testid":"eb-preview"},{"kind":"textContains","label":"current draft is the fresh Untitled email","testid":"eb-current-draft","text":"Untitled email"}],"executor":"data","file":"01-first-run.png","group":"first-run","id":"first-run","liveClass":"live","mockLimited":null,"name":"first-run","spends":false,"viewport":"desktop","visit":"first-run"},{"executor":"code","file":"02-seeded-library.png","group":"library","handler":"seededLibrary","id":"seeded-library","liveClass":"live","mockLimited":null,"name":"seeded-library","spends":false,"viewport":"desktop","visit":"seeded-interview"},{"executor":"code","file":"03-interview-draft.png","group":"interview","handler":"interviewDraftOpened","id":"interview-draft-opened","liveClass":"live","mockLimited":null,"name":"interview-draft-opened","spends":false,"viewport":"desktop","visit":"seeded-interview"},{"execut